<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended higher in very quiet trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average rose 23.83 points to 6,546.68.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite index rose 2.07 to 397.07.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose 22 cents.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1,576 to 831.</p>
<p>Volume was 253,425,790, the lightest for a full trading session this year, compared with 167,165,370 in an abbreviated Christmas Eve session on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Financial markets were closed on Wednesday.</p>
